{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026vSbCpEb8L21795578073.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>網上流傳3段多角度車Cam影片，記錄了昨晚（24日）約10時20分在深水埗發生的一宗驚險5車連環相撞交通意外。</p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-25-11h34m29s932.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20265PmSpvLBVk1795578044.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>根據車Cam畫面顯示，一輛空載市區的士疑因收掣不及，先猛烈撞向同在左線的一輛電單車，同時波及旁邊中線的黑色私家車；電單車被撞後翻側，身穿深色衣物及戴頭盔的鐵騎士隨即被拋出倒地。</p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-25-11h34m06s719.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ryve1IGXpg1795578051.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>肇事紅的撞倒電單車後並未即時停下，再狠狠撞向前方一輛白色私家車的車尾，衝力之大令該白色私家車再被推前，撞向前面另一輛白色私家車，釀成5車連環相撞，肇事紅的車頭蓋撞至嚴重變形拱起。</p><p></p><p>警方表示，事件中25歲鄧姓鐵騎士腳部受傷，67歲譚姓的士司機報稱不適，兩人均保持清醒，事後由救護車送往明愛醫院接受治理，警方正調查意外起因。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T04:23:52.816313+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":305,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T03:40:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T10:37:15.630820+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T04:17:14.530598+00:00","content_hash":"31132cfabf58fa05cb648cb5c3bd0906dce4d971d70d4c07fd144f65c324d7da","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T04:23:52.816313+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}